      "body": "DESCOPED by maintainer decision (2026-07-23): the +5pp stretch target is structurally unreachable by agreement-margin regardless of teacher — under EXCT precedence the graph is argmax-IDENTICAL to the baseline on every measured partition (fixture 31.7%, D3 natural 15.04%, continuity 14.76%, all with +0/-0 win/loss). A larger teacher raises the floor for every scorer equally, which changes the level but not the stretch margin. If the M.V.G. §4 stretch clause is reframed (bits-margin or residual-value target instead of agreement-over-baseline), this issue reopens with a clear role: raising the floor. Work stopped ~12 minutes in; no artifacts produced, nothing to clean up. Priority went to completing tracker #65.",
